  <name>App Encloser</name>
  <summary>Isolated Portable Application &amp; Package Manager</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      App Encloser encloses Linux application packages (.deb, .AppImage, .tar.gz, etc.)
      into self-contained user directories with private configurations, zero background
      daemons, and optional Bubblewrap filesystem sandboxing.
    </p>
  </description>
